{"id":"zlost_","lemma":"злость","pos":"noun","rank":3299,"glosses":["spite, malice, rage, anger, grudge (a strong feeling of displeasure, hostility or antagonism towards someone or something)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"злости","plural":"злости"},"examples":[{"text":"Том не умел сдерживать злость.","en":"Tom couldn't control his anger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655408","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"уметь"},{"g":"to hold in"},null]},{"text":"Тома охватывает злость.","en":"Tom is getting angry.","words":[{"g":"volume","l":"том"},null,null]},{"text":"Том старался вести себя нормально, но по выражению его лица и поведению было видно, что он кипел от злости.","en":"Tom tried to act normal, but you could tell from his facial expression and demeanor that he was seething with rage.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"стараться"},null,null,{"g":"normally"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"along / by"},null,{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"face","l":"лицо"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"it is visible"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"from"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"to behave"]]}]}